{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103171","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103171","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1410317101:4":{"text":"漫漫……我们刚刚是不是听到了一些不得了的事情……","source_cn":"漫漫……我们刚刚是不是听到了一些不得了的事情……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8706A9794B68A58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1410317102:1":{"text":"没错，我现在有一堆问题！","source_cn":"没错，我现在有一堆问题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EBD8AE4EB11B023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410317103:1":{"text":"祖娅，你和弗林他们真不是一伙的？！","source_cn":"祖娅，你和弗林他们真不是一伙的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA32DBD21D4AD8812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410317104:1":{"text":"当然，到底要我说几次！","source_cn":"当然，到底要我说几次！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F60512E144FC39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410317105:1":{"text":"明明刚才话里那么熟络的样子……既然如此，那请你把自己知道的事情都告诉我们，不要再有所隐瞒了！","source_cn":"明明刚才话里那么熟络的样子……既然如此，那请你把自己知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF15A335D72EC391","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410317106:1":{"text":"好吧，我考虑一下！不过，你们到底想知道什么啊？","source_cn":"好吧，我考虑一下！不过，你们到底想知道什么啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0331F25DB0DCADF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410317106":{"text":"好吧，我考虑一下！不过，你们到底想知道什么啊？","source_cn":"好吧，我考虑一下！不过，你们到底想知道什么啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0331F25DB0DCADF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410317107:1":{"text":"还不是信仰问题。耀光境内都信艾雅……","source_cn":"还不是信仰问题。耀光境内都信艾雅……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF85EDF05B88792F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410317108:1":{"text":"但赫托老爹才是我们矮人最初侍奉的神明。就算老爹没了，有的同胞也不想改信。喏，就是深岩村那群人。所以他们想建个神殿——","source_cn":"但赫托老爹才是我们矮人最初侍奉的神明。就算老爹没了，有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8991B6AD6018CE6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410317109:1":{"text":"但要我说真没什么意思，信仰在心里，不依赖外物。","source_cn":"但要我说真没什么意思，信仰在心里，不依赖外物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0ACA4A2564A2129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410317110:0":{"text":"赫托老爹早没了，没得干干净净，也不会回来了。","source_cn":"赫托老爹早没了，没得干干净净，也不会回来了。","